meta {
  name: 05 Settlements
  seq: 5
}

docs {
  # Finance → Settlements

  Referral settlements (`/finance/settlements`). Backend-wired. Settlements are
  created ONLY from selected Collection-report order records (the four referral
  parties: B2B / REFERRED_BY / INTERNAL_REFERRAL_USER / EXTERNAL_REFERRAL_USER).
  The financial basis is the COLLECTED (paid) amount; all money is re-derived
  server-side. Lifecycle: Pending Approval → Approved / Rejected → Partially
  Settled → Settled. Balance = Approved − cumulative Settled.
}
